<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 5.78 points to 6,442.49.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite index fell 2.77 to 389.53.</p>
<p>The average price per share lost 29 cents.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1,848 to 786.</p>
<p>Volume was 461,025,990, compared with 395,152,360 on Tuesday. The market was closed on Wednesday for New Year's Day.</p>
